conversations and instantly surface key insights and clarity. ... Shockingly accurate transcripts, instant summaries, and action items with consistent quality across every call – delivered straight to your inbox, like magic. ... 'Ask Fathom' anything about your meetings – a place to search everything, and get customizable AI summaries tailored to your team's workflow and priorities so you spend less time searching and more time doing. ... Meeting notes, insights and action items sync automatically with your tools – Slack, Salesforce, HubSpot, Notion, Asana, and beyond – without you lifting a finger. ... ## Fathom teams ‍ work smarter ... say Fathom helps them stay fully present in meetings ... meeting insights to actionable next ... Shared understanding. Faster execution. Better results. ... ### Works where you meet Google Meet ... ### Fathom adapts to your workflow, not the other way around. Empower your team’s best work with seriously accurate AI notetaking ... Fathom captures context, tracks engagement and updates your CRM, while you handle the close. AI Scorecards help managers coach with confidence, improving performance effortlessly. ... Fathom captures key moments, surfaces risks and opportunities, automates CRM updates and follow-ups, and spots trends across conversations — so your team can spend less time on admin and more time delivering value. ... Spot trending feedback and changes in user sentiment, harvest invaluable insights for content, capture context, campaigns, brainstorms, project calls, and so much more. ... Track everything, get clear action points from every conversation, and watch as your team moves from ‘we should do that’ to ‘consider it done’ ... Spot the patterns that predict success, streamline interviews and evaluate candidates with Ask Fathom. Highlights playlists give new employees the tools to flourish. ... Track and synthesize feature requests, monitor user satisfaction, and build the features that matter most to your customers.\",\n        \"position\": 1\n      },\n      {\n        \"url\": \"https://fathom.org/\",\n        \"title\": \"Fathom\",\n        \"description\": \"Fathom Applauds Introduction of ... FRONTIER Act, the First ... for Independent AI Verification | Read Our ... Fathom is an independent nonprofit that finds, builds, and scales policy and technical innovations designed for the AI century. Our mission is to co-design an AI future that works for all. About Fathom ... ## We find, build, and scale practical solutions to navigate the transition to a world with AI ... **We translate **research, shared values, and policy goals into real solutions that ensure AI benefits our society. **We secure **legislative and policy wins that benefit the public interest and prioritize both trust and innovation. We collaborate** **with partners across government, industry, and civil society to build safety and trust architectures. ... ## Independent. Nonpartisan. Nonprofit. Fathom is a 501(c)(3) organization funded by philanthropists. We do not take donations from corporations, including frontier labs and the FAA...", "duration_ms": 1877, "is_error": false, "timestamp": 1790739919105}
